    ],
    "text": "Notice under Section 07",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      94.8,
      370.8,
      297.38,
      392.87
    ],
    "text": "My Reference No. : RPDS/LND/09/ACQ/15/(CEB).Land Ministry Reference No. : 4-3/2/2016/CEB/401.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      71.04,
      402.0,
      297.59,
      448.07
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section (7)of the Land Acquisition Act, that the Government intendsto acquire the following land which is required for a publicpurpose:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      102.0,
      457.2,
      266.02,
      467.27
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Lands to be acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      71.04,
      474.0,
      297.38,
      544.07
    ],
    "text": "Following allotments of land depicted as Lot No. 377 inPlan No. F.V.P. 377 made by Survey General, situated inNugepola Village in 164 Gallella Grama Niladhari Divisionof Uda Paththuwa sub division in Divisional Secretary'sDivision Rathnapura in the District of Rathnapura inSabaragamuwa Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      71.04,
      558.0,
      297.11,
      604.07
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 377Name of the Land: Galaboda; Land Use: Open barrenland; Claimant: Hapugasthenna Plantation, No. 95/A,Nambapana, Ingiriya; Extent: 1.4489 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      322.8,
      321.84,
      561.81,
      383.51
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid lands on which ser-vitude is to be acquired are here by requested to appear per-sonally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at10.00 a.m. on 28th February 2019 at Divisional SecretariatRathnapura.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      322.8,
      400.32,
      561.92,
      474.95
    ],
    "text": "Moreover, they are hereby requested to notify to me inwriting with two duplicates on or before 21st February 2019the nature of their interests in the Land, the particulars oftheir claims for compensation for acquisition of the said lands,the amount of compensation and the details of theComputation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
